WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.703
Do you have siblings?

00:00:01.953 --> 00:00:05.763
Yes, I have a sister. Her name is Emma.

00:00:06.013 --> 00:00:07.712
What does she like doing?

00:00:07.962 --> 00:00:11.084
She likes reading and playing football.

00:00:11.334 --> 00:00:13.779
We play together on Sundays.
